  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation Dialogue as an instrument in Swedish   development cooperation - the case of Gender      Equality - Dialogue on Gender Policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering Dialog som instrument f&#xf6;r Sveriges    utvecklingssamarbete - fallstudie j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Dialog &#xe4;r en v&#xe4;letablerad del av utvecklingssamarbetet. De metoder    och m&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r dialogen &#xe4;r dock s&#xe4;llan f&#xf6;rtydligade eller utv&#xe4;rderade.   Policydialog har aldrig varit f&#xf6;rem&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r en s&#xe4;rskild utv&#xe4;rdering p&#xe5;  Sida och denna utv&#xe4;rdering tittar p&#xe5; genderdialog mer specifik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue is a well-established component of development co-operation. However, the methods by which it is carried out and the objectives to which dialogue is to contribute, are rarely clarified or dissected.   Policy dialogue has never been the subject of a specific evaluation   at Sida and this one delineates the subject of gender dialogue more   specifically.</narrative>
  </description>
